<title>THAILAND: Thai July C/A deficit narrows to 30.8 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai July C/A deficit narrows to 30.8 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's July current account deficit narrowed to an estimated 30.8 billion baht from a revised 35.4 billion baht deficit in June, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   July 96     June 96	  July 95</p>
<p>				 30.8	  35.4	     26.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht. June figure was revised.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
